<article class="env-lemma" id="080L">
       
      
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/080L">Lemma <span data-tag="080L">31.35.2</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated scheme. Let $U \subset X$ be a quasi-compact open subscheme. Let $b : X' \to X$ be a $U$-admissible blowup. Let $X'' \to X'$ be a $U$-admissible blowup. Then the composition $X'' \to X$ is a $U$-admissible blowup. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate from the more precise Lemma <a href="/tag/080B" data-tag="080B">31.33.14</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>